            "media_upload": 0,
            "default_value": "In the world of wellness, what is genuine always moves gently from within. Through our Spa Operation and Franchise Partnerships, Sandjong welcomes you to build spaces that honor tradition while embracing the needs of today. With the guidance of Amerta Jiwa Indonesia, we offer cultural depth, thoughtful service, and seasoned expertise to help you cultivate a sanctuary of your own, in any place you choose."
